Report template for "go-licenses report", producing
"<import path>,<version>,<license type>".

go-licenses' default report puts a link to the license file in the second
column, which it resolves over the network. That lookup makes the report
non-deterministic, and when it succeeds it points into the module's major
version directory, where no license file exists (google/go-licenses#131).
The version is taken from the module graph, so it is stable offline.
*/ -}}
